     1615             end.
     1616           end.
     1617         end.
     1618       end.
     1619       else do:
     1620         for each buf_temp-diasize-handle
     1621         on error undo move_block, retry move_block
     1622         :
     1623           assign
     1624             v-object-handle = buf_temp-diasize-handle.handle-value
     1625           .
     1626           if v-object-handle <> v-diasize-resize-button
