     1783     on error undo move_block, leave move_block
     1784     :
     1785       if retry
     1786       then do:
     1787         do
     1788         on error undo move_block, leave move_block
     1789         :
     1790           if p-change-value > 0
     1791           then do:
     1792             for each buf_temp-diasize-handle
     1793             on error undo, next
     1794             :
     1795               assign
     1796                 v-object-handle = buf_temp-diasize-handle.handle-value
     1797               .
